{
  "id": "PRO.20",
  "number": "20",
  "bookId": "PRO",
  "reference": "Prov. 20",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wine is a mocker and beer a brawler;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 20:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "whoever is led astray by them is not wise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A king's wrath strikes terror like the roar of a lion;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 20:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "those who anger him forfeit their lives.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is to one's honor to avoid strife,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 20:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "but every fool is quick to quarrel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sluggards do not plow in season;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 20:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "so at harvest time they look but find nothing.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The purposes of a person's heart are deep waters,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 20:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "but one who has insight draws them out.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Many claim to have unfailing love,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 20:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "but a faithful person who can find?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The righteous lead blameless lives;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 20:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "blessed are their children after them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When a king sits on his throne to judge,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 20:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "he winnows out all evil with his eyes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who can say, \"I have kept my heart pure;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 20:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I am clean and without sin\"?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Differing weights and differing measures—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 20:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.20.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.20.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "detests them both.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Even small children are known by their actions,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 20:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "so is their conduct really pure and upright?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ears that hear and eyes that see—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 20:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.20.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.20.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has made them both.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not love sleep or you will grow poor;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 20:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "stay awake and you will have food to spare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"It's no good, it's no good!\" says the buyer—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 20:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "then goes off and boasts about the purchase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gold there is, and rubies in abundance,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 20:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "but lips that speak knowledge are a rare jewel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Take the garment of one who puts up security for a stranger;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 20:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "hold it in pledge if it is done for an outsider.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Food gained by fraud tastes sweet,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PRO 20:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "but one ends up with a mouth full of gravel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
